00:02:06.010 --> 00:02:07.611
Another interesting discussion on the red.

00:02:07.611 --> 00:02:09.250
It is black.

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:15.880
Ryan said we should start making a distinction
between the progressive left and the populist

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:23.930
left, pointing out that populism wants to
appeal to ordinary people who feel their concerns

00:02:23.930 --> 00:02:29.880
are disregarded, whereas progressivism is
a particular political philosophy supporting

00:02:29.880 --> 00:02:34.290
social reform and certain policy ideas.

00:02:34.290 --> 00:02:37.300
I want to be careful about this for two reasons.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:44.790
Number one, when we go crazy with how we name
different groups and categorize different

00:02:44.790 --> 00:02:49.040
people, it's often not useful at all and is
often a distraction.

00:02:49.040 --> 00:02:53.370
And you know, you if you've listened to some
of the pedantic phone calls, I will sometimes

00:02:53.370 --> 00:02:59.990
get during live calls from people saying,
you know, I used to be a civil libertarian,

00:02:59.990 --> 00:03:06.210
but now I am a moderate and cap or whatever
it is, it gets us very little.

00:03:06.210 --> 00:03:09.860
It gets us very little in actually figuring
out how society, culture and the economy should

00:03:09.860 --> 00:03:10.860
go.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:12.720
So here's my one thought.

00:03:12.720 --> 00:03:14.670
Populism can be left or right.

00:03:14.670 --> 00:03:18.140
Populism in and of itself can can be left
or right.

00:03:18.140 --> 00:03:23.150
And as the viewer is saying, we're distinguishing
between the progressive left and the populist

00:03:23.150 --> 00:03:24.170
left.

00:03:24.170 --> 00:03:29.170
I actually think that populist left implies
progressivism.

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.950
So for me, there's not really a conflict.

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:36.280
The populist left has elements of populism
with progressive social policy, progressive

00:03:36.280 --> 00:03:38.380
economic policy, et cetera.

00:03:38.380 --> 00:03:40.640
I would not overly focus on these labels.

00:03:40.640 --> 00:03:43.310
Check out some of the work from the new schools.

